  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Bacon Jam",
  "description": "This bacon jam recipe made with crispy bacon, onions, brown sugar, and vinegar will make burgers, sandwiches, or a cheese board much more special.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
